message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the paper below (preferred) and, if you need a software record, this repository."
title: "Activation functions for necrotic-core segmentation in glioblastoma (BraTS 2020) - code and results"
abstract: >-
  Training, evaluation and analysis code, per-patient metrics, training logs and
  figures for a controlled ablation of twelve activation functions in a residual
  3D U-Net on the BraTS 2020 cohort, with three-seed, five-fold cross-validation
  and same-GPU timing follow-ups.
